  <ThingDef ParentName="BigBirdThingBase">
    <defName>RG_TerrorBird</defName>
    <label>terror bird</label>
    <description>A once extinct species of large carnivorous flightless birds who are described by locals by the far more apt moniker “terror birds'' due to the bowel-loosening terror caused by their sighting.\n\nPhorusrhacids have large, sharp beaks and powerful neck muscles that allow them to peck with a force strong enough to shatter bones and rip the flesh straight off their prey. Their legs are accented by large, sharp talons which allow them to quickly pursue their targets, following up with vicious kicks to disembowel them or hold them down while they strike down with their beak into vital organs.</description>
